# Leave unset. In dev the Vite proxy forwards /api and /uploads to the server,
# and on Vercel the rewrites in vercel.json forward them to Render - so the
# browser only ever talks to one origin and the login cookie stays first-party.
# Setting this to the Render URL makes the cookie third-party, which many
# browsers block (users get logged out on refresh).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
